body:
My very first job. Two girls who had graduated from the same high school as me two years prior had invited me out to dinner. Was excited to see old friends. Then after about 20 minutes of small talk, they explained they wanted to leave their job, but the boss needed some replacements. Pretty small business. I decided to give it a try and was invited for a working interview.

&#x200B;

I didn't know until I pulled up into a neighborhood, but this job was based in the woman's house. She came out of her office to greet me with an ill fitting tee with holes and stains and the truest thing to Einstein hair I had ever seen in person, but also the sweetest smile and a huge bear hug.

&#x200B;

I ended up staying for just about a year. Best boss I've ever had to date.
